      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peach_Bottom%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The original town and its station were submerged when the Conowingo Dam was built in 1926‑28.",
